# Input

```svelte
<div style:background=green></div>
<div style:background="{color}"></div>
<div style:background='prefix{color}suffix'></div>
<div style:background={background}></div>

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
 <div style:background="green"></div>
-<div style:background={color}></div>
-<div style:background="prefix{color}suffix"></div>
-<div style:background></div>
+<div style:background="{color}"></div>
+<div style:background='prefix{color}suffix'></div>
+<div style:background={background}></div>
```

# Output

```svelte
<div style:background="green"></div>
<div style:background="{color}"></div>
<div style:background='prefix{color}suffix'></div>
<div style:background={background}></div>
```
